<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cure Light Wounds</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 0), Paladin (guild level 10)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cure light wounds &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cure light wounds</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Heals some of the target's lost hit points: the better your divine sphere, the 
more it heals. It works on humanoids and mammals, and always on yourself. You 
can cast it while fighting, and it is also found on scrolls, potions and 
staffs.
</p><p>It is the first spell a healer learns.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
